DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
9176::$$$message_0067_0000_0000$$$::I had made a promise to go home with Rider and Sakura.[lr]::
9177::$$$message_0067_0000_0001$$$::"Now... I wonder if they're waiting already."::
9178::$$$message_0067_0001_0000$$$::There is only Rider waiting at the gate.[lr]::
9179::$$$message_0067_0001_0001$$$::"Oh? Rider, where's Sakura?"::
9180::$$$message_0067_0002_0000$$$::"...I have a message from Sakura."[lr]::
9181::$$$message_0067_0002_0001$$$::A message must mean...[lr]::
9182::$$$message_0067_0002_0002$$$::"It seems that she has some miscellaneous duties for the upcoming kyudo club tournament.[lr]::
9183::$$$message_0067_0002_0003$$$::She said that she is sorry and to go home ahead of her."::
9184::$$$message_0067_0003_0000$$$::"I see. Sakura seems to be busy with her duties as the captain."[lr]::
9185::$$$message_0067_0003_0001$$$::"There is more to the message, but may I continue?"[lr]::
9186::$$$message_0067_0003_0002$$$::[font italic=true]Huh? There's more?[font italic=false][lr]::
9187::$$$message_0067_0003_0003$$$::Like she wants us to get milk and eggs, or there's not enough tofu?[lr]::
9188::$$$message_0067_0003_0004$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=ライダー私服01e(中) textoff=0]When I prompt Rider to continue, she continues talking in a begrudging tone.::
9189::$$$message_0067_0004_0000$$$::"She said that she will be late, so she said to go ahead with me."[lr]::
9190::$$$message_0067_0004_0001$$$::"...Is that really okay?"[lr]::
9191::$$$message_0067_0004_0002$$$::Rider should go home with Sakura, not me. She must know that too, as she continues mumbling inarticulately.::
9192::$$$message_0067_0005_0000$$$::"I said I would wait for her, but Sakura would not listen to me. She said that she does not know what time she will be done, and that 'Senpai' would be waiting for no reason if I do not take you home."::
9193::$$$message_0067_0006_0000$$$::"...So, please give up and promptly return home with me.[lr]::
9194::$$$message_0067_0006_0001$$$::I do not wish to make Sakura worried."[lr]::
9195::$$$message_0067_0006_0002$$$::"Got it, let's go home. I think I'll come get Sakura later."[lr]::
9196::$$$message_0067_0006_0003$$$::"Please leave the night escorting to me, Shirou."::
9197::$$$message_0067_0007_0000$$$::...Come to think of it, nothing like this has ever happened.[lr]::
9198::$$$message_0067_0007_0001$$$::[splinemove textoff=0 opacity=120 layer=base nospline=1 time=60000 path=(860,63,2.000)(-150,92,2.000) storage=o冬木市俯瞰(秋)-(夕) accel=-1.5]I've gone down this path with Sakura or Tohsaka, or even Issei, but I've never walked here with Rider.[lr]::
9199::$$$message_0067_0007_0002$$$::And we're even returning home together today.[lr]::
9200::$$$message_0067_0007_0003$$$::Of course it's refreshing.::
9201::$$$message_0067_0008_0000$$$::...Also, I'm glad it's a weekend.[lr]::
9202::$$$message_0067_0008_0001$$$::If this was a weekday, I'm sure I would be interrogated on what kind of relationship I have with this beauty.::
9203::$$$message_0067_0009_0000$$$::"Does it trouble you for me to accompany you, Shirou?"[lr]::
9204::$$$message_0067_0009_0001$$$::"No, I'm just a bit at a loss, since this is new."::
9205::$$$message_0067_0010_0000$$$::"Then, does what Sakura has left to do bother you, Shirou?"[lr]::
9206::$$$message_0067_0010_0001$$$::"...Yeah. I do wish there was something I could do to help.[lr]::
9207::$$$message_0067_0010_0002$$$::But Sakura is the kyudo club president, so it wouldn't be good for me to interfere."::
9208::$$$message_0067_0011_0000$$$::Quite a lot of time has passed since I left the club.[lr]::
9209::$$$message_0067_0011_0001$$$::Even if I'm Sakura's acquaintance, I must be just some outsider to the current first-years.[lr]::
9210::$$$message_0067_0011_0002$$$::My position is way different from the former captain, Mitsuzuri... Well, come to think of it, something that I've been wondering about is right next to me.::
9211::$$$message_0067_0012_0000$$$::"How have you been introduced to the kyudo club, Rider?"[lr]::
9212::$$$message_0067_0012_0001$$$::"Oh... [cacheimage storage=ライダー私服01a(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg storage=ライダー私服01a(中) time=300 textoff=0]That I'm someone who is being taken care of by Sakura's family."[lr]::
9213::$$$message_0067_0012_0002$$$::"Like a relative from overseas?"[lr]::
9214::$$$message_0067_0012_0003$$$::"There have been precedents like Illyasviel and Saber, so they do not seem to pry any further even if I am there."[lr]::
9215::$$$message_0067_0012_0004$$$::That's right.[lr]::
9216::$$$message_0067_0012_0005$$$::Come to think of it, there have been more and more foreign outsiders coming in and out of Homurahara's kyudo club.::
9217::$$$message_0067_0013_0000$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=ライダー私服01a(中) textoff=0]Illya's appearance left quite the impact... She's like a silver-haired child from a picture book or a movie, someone from a completely different world.::
9218::$$$message_0067_0014_0000$$$::"If there is a problem, it would be that whenever I happen to be near Ayako Mitsuzuri, she always seems to be uncomfortable.[lr]::
9219::$$$message_0067_0014_0001$$$::...Geez, she's not a deer in headlights. I must teach Ayako a lesson."::
9220::$$$message_0067_0015_0000$$$::"Well... That's not Mitsuzuri's fault..."[lr]::
9221::$$$message_0067_0015_0001$$$::If anything, she's looking at her like that because it's her.[lr]::
9222::$$$message_0067_0015_0002$$$::She has some memory that she was attacked by something and had her blood sucked, but she doesn't know who it was.[lr]::
9223::$$$message_0067_0015_0003$$$::And.[lr]::
9224::$$$message_0067_0015_0004$$$::That criminal is unmistakably Rider.[lr]::
9225::$$$message_0067_0015_0005$$$::"...A deer in headlights? That's exactly how it was."::
9226::$$$message_0067_0016_0000$$$::"That is rude of you too, Shirou. I would never do anything as boorish as crashing into what I took a liking to.[lr]::
9227::$$$message_0067_0016_0001$$$::Also, Ayako is not a deer, but a mouse. Or should I say a fox cub."[lr]::
9228::$$$message_0067_0016_0002$$$::"...You're the one who said a deer."::
9229::$$$message_0067_0017_0000$$$::"It is a figure of speech.[lr]::
9230::$$$message_0067_0017_0001$$$::...Anyway, I have had an unfortunate course of events with her, but I would like to reconcile with her.[lr]::
9231::$$$message_0067_0017_0002$$$::I am counting on you when the time comes, Shirou."[lr]::
9232::$$$message_0067_0017_0003$$$::"...Got it, I'll mediate to the best of my ability."[cacheimage storage=ライダー私服01c(中)][wvs][chgfg time=300 storage=ライダー私服01c(中) textoff=0]::
9233::$$$message_0067_0018_0000$$$::We talk about worthless topics, as we take our time going down the hill.[lr]::
9234::$$$message_0067_0018_0001$$$::It's not bad to go home together quietly, either.::
9235::$$$message_0067_0019_0000$$$::"Rider..."[lr]::
9236::$$$message_0067_0019_0001$$$::"What is it, Shirou?"[lr]::
9237::$$$message_0067_0019_0002$$$::"...Never mind."[lr]::
9238::$$$message_0067_0019_0003$$$::I can't help but shut up when she looks back at me with such a smile.[lr]::
9239::$$$message_0067_0019_0004$$$::The conversation would keep on going if there were someone else, but when it's just the two of us walking, there's still a bit of awkwardness.::
9240::$$$message_0067_0020_0000$$$::Even then, we were able to talk about all sorts of things today... I had some pretty scary experiences with Rider, but I feel that she's reliable enough to override them.[lr]::
9241::$$$message_0067_0020_0001$$$::A much older sister...different from Fuji-nee. She's dependable, but somewhat reckless; an unbalanced charm.[lr]::
9242::$$$message_0067_0020_0002$$$::She's scary and hard to approach at times, but I'm able to feel close to her at other times.[lr]::
9243::$$$message_0067_0020_0003$$$::Without a word, I stare at Rider's ribbon swaying in the wind, and just like that...::
9244::$$$message_0067_0021_0000$$$::...We reach home.::
9245::$$$message_0067_0022_0000$$$::"I have delivered you home as per my mission."[lr]::
9246::$$$message_0067_0022_0001$$$::"Good work. Well, I should go in and start preparing dinner before Sakura comes home."::
9247::$$$message_0067_0023_0000$$$::"What will you do, Rider? Do you want some tea or anything?"[lr]::
9248::$$$message_0067_0023_0001$$$::"No, I will turn back right away and go get Sakura.[lr]::
9249::$$$message_0067_0023_0002$$$::Well then, Shirou, I am off."[lr]::
9250::$$$message_0067_0023_0003$$$::She displays an admirable and unwavering loyalty towards Sakura that's very becoming of Rider.[lr]::
9251::$$$message_0067_0023_0004$$$::It gets dark early on in the fall, so I'm more relieved that Rider is with Sakura instead of her going home alone.::
9252::$$$message_0067_0024_0000$$$::"I see. Then, tell her that I'll be making dinner today."[lr]::
9253::$$$message_0067_0024_0001$$$::"Understood. See you..."[lr]::
9254::$$$message_0067_0024_0002$$$::"Welcome back, Shirou. Are you going back out, Rider?"[lr]::
9255::$$$message_0067_0024_0003$$$::"I will return your Master; [cacheimage storage=セイバー私服04e(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=セイバー私服04e(中) textoff=0]and I will go protect my own Master.[lr]::
9256::$$$message_0067_0024_0004$$$::I shall excuse myself now..."::
909211::$$$message_9067_0012_0000$$$::"How have you been introduced to the kyudo club, Rider?"[r]:��